this street. Turn left at the lights.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about a neighborhood.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dry cleaner", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place where someone cleans your clothes and fixes them", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Where is the dry cleaner? I need to fix this jacket.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le06ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "post office", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place where you can send letters and packages", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to go to the post office to send a letter.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le06ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "drugstore", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place to buy medicine", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Why don't you go to the drugstore if you don't feel good?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le06ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hotel", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place where people pay to stay the night and can eat meals", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The restaurant in this hotel is very good.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le06ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bakery", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place to buy bread or cake", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sally always goes to the bakery to buy bread.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le06ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "deli", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a store selling prepared foods like sandwiches, salads, and drinks", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This deli has great sandwiches.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le06ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le06ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Draw a map of your neighborhood. Include 10 places.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 5 sentences to describe the location of 5 places on the map.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use 1 preposition of place for each of the sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use at least 3 target words.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify places on a map.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe places in the neighborhood.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the location of places.", "type": "text"}]}]}